    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Last December 22, my parents and I arrived in Iceland for a vacation. This country only gets about five hours of sunshine in December. The sun doesn’t rise until about an hour before noon and sets at around 4 p.m. The next morning, when we left for our "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "glacier hike",
            "zh": "冰川徒步旅行"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " at 8 a.m., it was very dark. It felt like we were travelling at night."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before the hike, our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "guide",
            "ref": "v-guide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " asked us to put on "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "protective helmets",
            "zh": "防护头盔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and special shoes. This way, we wouldn’t fall or get hurt easily while walking on the ice. Our guide led us on our climb up the glacier and on our visit to a huge "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ice cave",
            "zh": "冰洞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The cave was so cool!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On the third day, we visited an old "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "lava tunnel",
            "zh": "熔岩隧道"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Iceland is home to more than 130 "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "volcanoes",
            "zh": "火山"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The tunnel had been "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "formed",
            "ref": "v-form"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by a volcanic "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "eruption",
            "zh": "爆发"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a long time ago. The dried lava formed many interesting shapes."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Around 1 a.m. on our fourth day, we were all in a deep sleep when the hotel front desk "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "woke us up",
            "ref": "v-wake-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with a Northern Lights "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "alarm call",
            "zh": "叫醒电话"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". We put on our warm clothing, ran downstairs and saw the Northern Lights! The green, purple, red and yellow lights were "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "displayed",
            "ref": "v-display"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in many amazing patterns. It was like these lights were dancing in the sky. After more than half an hour, the light show stopped. We went back to bed, but I was still super "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "excited",
            "ref": "v-excited"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "During the next few days, we visited many other places in Iceland. After finishing our "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "week-long trip",
            "ref": "v-week-long-trip"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", we came back home. This tour was so wonderful!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
